-- paperclip:migration-safety-ignore large-create-index-not-concurrently: Drizzle migrations run transactionally, so CONCURRENTLY is unavailable. Run secret redaction for an issue (valuesForIssue) ORs context_snapshot issueId with paperclipIssue.id; without this index the second arm forces a sequential scan that detoasts every run snapshot of the company on each issue, comment and queue read. The one-time build lock is the lesser cost.
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "heartbeat_runs_company_ctx_paperclip_issue_idx" ON "heartbeat_runs" USING btree ("company_id", (("context_snapshot" -> 'paperclipIssue') ->> 'id'));
